{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內褲的洗滌與晾曬方式，直接影響私密處健康。</p><p>台灣無毒教母譚敦慈在節目《小宇宙大爆發》中指出，超過九成的人晾內褲的方式都有誤，加上許多女性習慣在浴室手洗後直接晾乾，潮濕環境反而助長黴菌滋生，提高感染風險。</p><p>同場加映：洗衫貼士｜九成人內褲晾法都錯！學會正確晾曬方法　守護私處健康（點擊放大瀏覽）▼▼▼</p><figure><img alt=\"常見錯誤晾內褲方式（小紅書@TXDW2018；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240614/878232842855780352176908.png/MKfk2N3k-9n2q578jP7ZcRwyOpCFE8jlkiXm7ZIl5u0\"/><figcaption>常見錯誤晾內褲方式（小紅書@TXDW2018；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 將內褲直接掛在晾衣架上（小紅書@1571483513；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779561965752320735964.png/JR8PFXlAbLB88f2F3GFX3W7KeyP5DhhUWygu1FsoLtQ\"/><figcaption>1. 將內褲直接掛在晾衣架上（小紅書@1571483513；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 將內褲直接掛在晾衣架上（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779564419551232362890.png/g6imds6dURPAzErNeHzTnEKbWFpLoQtNFfhGNhX4RjY\"/><figcaption>1. 將內褲直接掛在晾衣架上（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"i. 平衡掛曬法（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877169268226002944827691.png/qpfxKaZtqbclnA1dmDtCyWDU07OWZb-NLGv1jSxr9Y0\"/><figcaption>i. 平衡掛曬法（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"ii. 夾子掛曬（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877169270264565760659401.png/Jr8IfZyOrk9dHRtD1NT--Vs_2yBGpc-tV0UbXFdFG1w\"/><figcaption>ii. 夾子掛曬（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"iii. 單邊夾子掛曬（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240611/877169272772890624961583.png/QEpUsJoRn3z955nIzYroOBxaown72H81lu-_jpbvv44\"/><figcaption>iii. 單邊夾子掛曬（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2.  在潮濕的環境中晾乾（Unsplash@Greg Rosenke；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779556143796224253817.png/Ck77qwZSkijF_NZV9i8YtrtrtY_EXHJDLNvVfSzb1X0\"/><figcaption>2.  在潮濕的環境中晾乾（Unsplash@Greg Rosenke；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2.  在潮濕的環境中晾乾（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779558765367296069254.png/3d1vND3B0FBSBtFg1CTIrP47WIcoREfQ11-q49dfquM\"/><figcaption>2.  在潮濕的環境中晾乾（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3.  長時間陽光直射（Unsplash@Adeolu Eletu；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779561214971904240315.png/kVEPf-C6hAp_kIcoqR-PpzS-8kKjkUaOhCJMH4QiTB8\"/><figcaption>3.  長時間陽光直射（Unsplash@Adeolu Eletu；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3.  長時間陽光直射（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875779563450667008417386.png/WYZITtYNRySIMMsmAkrFoIxomChEEsznhnv2ZoZ79mY\"/><figcaption>3.  長時間陽光直射（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"正確晾內褲方式（小紅書@4271796977；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240608/876132524194009088789156.png/LfPY2YAwo54h8UG4fPPRpZ6VAc48T5JPmYu9ApmLvQI\"/><figcaption>正確晾內褲方式（小紅書@4271796977；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"正確晾內褲方式（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194226417602560270485.jpeg/oEIlGAatIWrFriDX19LlqnZiIajSPlteMmhkvTJoZL0\"/><figcaption>正確晾內褲方式（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"正確晾內褲方式（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194229169197056354960.jpeg/JFlJwzcaNrqI3JMDsUZsoKSwzyUUBxxNGDCUfBgwlHw\"/><figcaption>正確晾內褲方式（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 選擇通風良好的地方（小紅書@619096403；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194231434252288173298.jpeg/RoQ9zGMbyV1f-YI9hJMZ6Vk0vfgk-6J0TSDBuk0gwbo\"/><figcaption>1. 選擇通風良好的地方（小紅書@619096403；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"1. 選擇通風良好的地方（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194233825136640982641.jpeg/iLFc0Z-J1pLsIVaIiWfA9M4O1PM327e5DGVYzwxlWM8\"/><figcaption>1. 選擇通風良好的地方（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2. 避免陽光直射（小紅書@619096403；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194236157300736031674.jpeg/lLXKMdtHeHVyxLFPTzc4gshghsD60CnwQl8LpEJfC6Q\"/><figcaption>2. 避免陽光直射（小紅書@619096403；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2. 避免陽光直射（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194224681160704863421.jpeg/x2H5mhbIxY8DsB7LcRK7rkGC3ymu2xFZ9dVw8_XVcPM\"/><figcaption>2. 避免陽光直射（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3. 使用內褲專用夾子（Instagram@andenhud；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194227269177344643859.jpeg/3ZQU0S-L21q91O6ryI3Bxrr0mSqeGygGNrHUazax1Gs\"/><figcaption>3. 使用內褲專用夾子（Instagram@andenhud；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"3. 使用內褲專用夾子（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147194229513261056489702.jpeg/WZ7gufY8se1aRJO18-6-XQOC9r9Ar3TDbg5g8G4OYPA\"/><figcaption>3. 使用內褲專用夾子（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>晾曬方式上，褲襠朝上才是正確做法。譚敦慈說明，內褲最厚的布料集中於褲襠部位，若以衣架撐開或用夾子夾住上方晾曬，受地心引力影響，水分與濕氣會往褲襠集中，導致最難乾燥的部位反而最後乾燥，無論使用衣架或夾子，都應將褲襠朝上，才能讓厚布料充分接觸空氣。</p><p>清洗程序同樣不可忽略。譚敦慈建議，洗滌前應先將內褲浸泡於稀釋漂白水中約十分鐘，稀釋比例為清水九份、漂白水一份；若內褲沾有經血，可加入雙氧水搓洗。浸泡完成後，應放入洗衣袋以洗衣機清洗，每個洗衣袋裝至五分滿為限，避免過滿導致清洗效果不佳，手洗後直接晾在浴室的方式則被她列為「最NG」的行為。</p><p>目前正值梅雨季節，即便將內褲晾在室外一整天，收進室內後仍可能殘留濕氣。譚敦慈建議，收回後可搭配除濕機使用，並以電熨斗燙過一遍，藉此徹底除濕並達到殺菌效果，再收入衣櫃存放，可有效降低私密處感染的機率。</p><p>此外，內褲的使用年限也需定期檢視。譚敦慈表示，應將內褲視為消耗品，一般人建議每三個月汰換一次；若為容易流汗的運動員，則建議縮短至每兩個月更換，避免纖維長期累積難以清除的細菌與髒污。</p><p>同場加映：私密處清潔產品點樣揀？專家：揀錯pH值殺死好菌引來異味、念珠菌（點擊放大瀏覽）▼▼▼</p><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643354345410560210783.png/0aCtyGG-HG7sWKKkKK1OFn9SdZHsGyHLAfuStgH7krY\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（Karolina Grabowska@pexels；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643356870512640174296.png/3wvLMQTrHiAGe57mib_diD_UC7QaRPs4cWJ1F3FidRc\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（Karolina Grabowska@pexels；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643362411319296810642.png/0CZOEqSdNsGFxKdm4Uz5ONKNibYWQqkr6wQQk-sEEJM\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643364902866944085416.png/c5OasJFb8k0YBeQR7264ZDqY0YbTqlcPqT7x36k-8d8\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（Yaroslav Shuraev@pexels；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643367084036096932405.png/2hei-G_VuaFz-c64OHcbysw-soL7N_OUrXSqw610qsM\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（Yaroslav Shuraev@pexels；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643369571389440579403.png/eeTrj-RHjCmCRQsvkD2BUr798rHd0ExU_UpDbf1KQ20\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643372302012416629073.png/IUCF_WILL_CHA5R-tnkBArP40-ttO8KdC_t1nwv7dZ8\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（Pixabay@pexels；01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643374856474624730249.png/k0NxpzGTVCTCqfGt932T28uQY67Gs1Zq4ExYGuBMWBo\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（Pixabay@pexels；01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643376970534912206891.png/jvnDzVtNc1Yq2pbZz8TzZMpMlpwDQrOjWc3ewlnN3sI\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643379512414208238910.png/l8iWkvjybGtN-eJEcqglgvj81D3UMkxB3e-Xct3vl3I\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643349601652736964815.png/YOZrxmOgl_11wcUmcTcTUgGhuY6woh5tBfxXVgX8V1Y\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"溫和私密處清潔品推薦（綠藤生機、Apivita、SAUGELLA、HH、愛康、FOELLIE官網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643824644329472075821.png/3kMOeaDHymdmr1SfmMNYNmoQtGhoeZKyLJGoMCyRqDA\"/><figcaption>溫和私密處清潔品推薦（綠藤生機、Apivita、SAUGELLA、HH、愛康、FOELLIE官網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643352843980800374051.png/rVgrdRd6_RqMCINRLPF-w2q7_GeUlDDL4H2VO-B9lTs\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643355436191744853461.png/J9JZj8yL8GgAgAi7ECY7t2LJGWkXDhpEZ8CJDWfAiQ0\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643358196174848089412.png/wXTiCDM30Sdu4p9CHrsAL3C6ljoENmboJnJcRSZyXEU\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220321/582643360771608576031684.png/1IOZj1wTiXo-E-9T93MEqSBgkKk5FhMugUQaqoFEGqo\"/><figcaption>私密處清潔產品指南（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>「內褲卡屎」是真的！洗過也沒用　細菌超標10倍...半年就該換新</p><p>【本文獲「中天新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T07:14:17.249097+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1524,"images":35,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}